  "details": "Description\n\nEvery time my friend spawns any of his items, I can't see them. It started when we got the trampoline. I can see everything else (drone, stickers, emoji's etc.) just not any of his items.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nHonestly, no idea. I just haven't been able to see his items in a bit and it's getting frustrating. I don't know what else to put here to meet the character minimum.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1899-4a3804f9b1-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-27_23-35-14.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_c5ad1739-a0e9-429f-8e59-51c702f58f97/1/file)",
